[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8662.309, "timestamp": "02:24:22", "text": "。如果他能把这招带回来，想象一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8663.91, "timestamp": "02:24:23", "text": "他能绝地反击。如果他绝地反击，我们必须赢。算了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8668.429, "timestamp": "02:24:28", "text": "进攻方赢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8672.79, "timestamp": "02:24:32", "text": "好的。GG。GG。哦，老兄。你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8674.95, "timestamp": "02:24:34", "text": "的。是啊。是啊。好吧，那就这么办。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8677.11, "timestamp": "02:24:37", "text": "好啊。走吧。走吧。这游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8679.75, "timestamp": "02:24:39", "text": "在我这儿卡顿，所以没意思了。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8685.19, "timestamp": "02:24:45", "text": "啊。好的。让我打开斯特拉斯哈特。"}]